WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.797
The tailor climbed into bed.

2
00:00:12.798 --> 00:00:17.769
He shivered and moaned.

3
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:27.760
"Buttons! I need buttons for the coat."

4
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.701
Mrs. Tiggywinkle looked at the coat.

5
00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:36.131
"I will finish this coat.

6
00:00:36.132 --> 00:00:38.287
But I need help."

7
00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:42.406
Suddenly she smiled. "Of course!

8
00:00:42.407 --> 00:00:48.000
I know who can help me."

9
00:00:48.001 --> 00:01:00.935
Mrs. Tiggywinkle ran outside.

10
00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:05.758
She passed the shop. "Hmm," she said.

11
00:01:05.759 --> 00:01:07.858
"The shop is not closed today.

12
00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:12.694
It is open!"

13
00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:17.180
Mrs. Tiggywinkle hurried to the rabbits' house.

14
00:01:17.181 --> 00:01:19.489
She knocked on the door.

15
00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:25.245
"Bunnies!" she called. "I need help!"

16
00:01:25.246 --> 00:01:28.203
The three bunnies opened the door.

17
00:01:28.204 --> 00:01:32.710
"Will you help me sew a coat?" Mrs. Tiggywinkle asked.

18
00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:35.021
"It's for the mayor."

19
00:01:35.022 --> 00:01:38.255
"The mayor?" Flopsy squealed.

20
00:01:38.256 --> 00:01:41.866
"His coat?" Mopsy gasped.

21
00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:50.090
"Let's go!" Cotton-tail cried.

22
00:01:50.091 --> 00:01:55.094
The bunnies got their sewing baskets.

23
00:01:55.095 --> 00:02:10.129
They hopped to the tailor's house.

24
00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.962
Mrs. Tiggywinkle started to sew.

25
00:02:13.963 --> 00:02:21.794
The bunnies started to sew, and . . .

26
00:02:21.795 --> 00:02:25.959
Soon the coat was done!

27
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:34.121
"But something is missing," Flopsy said.

28
00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:40.887
"Buttons!" Mopsy and Cotton-tail said.

